cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: >-
  If you use this app, please cite the work it implements (preferred-citation), this release, and Pennsieve (RRID:SCR_021677); the other works it builds on are listed under references.
type: software
title: Spatial Cell-Cell Communication
abstract: Infers ligand-receptor communication between labelled cell types, domains or niches in spatial
  transcriptomics data with LIANA+. Per sample it ranks every ligand-receptor pair of LIANA's consensus
  resource for every source and target label with five methods aggregated into magnitude and specificity
  ranks, builds a consensus across samples, and on the top pairs computes spatially informed scores (global
  bivariate Moran's R and a local cosine score per observation) with permutation p-values, tables and figures.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/st-ccc
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- spatial-transcriptomics
- cell-cell-communication
- ligand-receptor
- liana
- xenium
- single-cell
# The work this app implements; the release report's "How to cite" puts it first.
